<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenia December unemployment rises to 14.4 pct.</title>
<headline>Slovenia December unemployment rises to 14.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Slovenian Statistical Office reported the following economic indicator details on Tuesday.</p>
<p>    SLOVENIAN UNEMPLOYMENT    Dec	 Nov     Dec95</p>
<p>    Percentage		    14.4     14.0     14.5</p>
<p>    Total			124,470  121,831  126,759</p>
<p>-- Ljubljana newsroom, 386-61-125-8439</p>
</text>
